WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.749 --> 00:00:17.829
What's good my well-read ballas? This week
we rememberin: Don't hate the playa, hate

00:00:17.829 --> 00:00:20.820
the GAME- with Ender's Game by Orson Scott Card.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:31.580
It's the future and you best believe dem humans
got their intergalactic travel game CLUTCH-status.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:36.940
Only prollem is: a crew of nasty aliens called
buggers, who been tusslin' over turf with

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:41.370
humans fo' way too long. Humanity ain't got
the numbers they got, so they all tweakin'

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:46.290
that the next time they go toe to toe with
the buggers, it'll be their last. So to get

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:51.550
the jump on dem creepers, da military hit
the streets lookin' for special genius-kids

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:57.920
to take their military strategy game next-level.
The book follow da military's best hope: six

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:05.000
year old Andrew Wiggin, or Ender to his boys.
Brutha may be a lil' G, but he is WICKED smart.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.039
So when some punk-ass bitch named Stilson
roll up with his gang tryna throw down, Ender

00:01:10.039 --> 00:01:15.630
make sho' dat fool don't neva' come trippin
to his face again: he actually KILLS Stilson,

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:21.220
even tho, at the time, he didn't know he jacked
him up so raw. Good thing too, cuz at his core,

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.170
Ender a sensitive lil' homie with a heart
of gold.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:29.640
Back at home, Ender always gettin' picked
on by his violent-ass 10 year old bro Peter.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:34.630
Ender's 8 year old sister Valentine, tho,
is way mo' chill, and she stick up fo' Ender

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:37.920
on the reg.
When word comes dat lil' Ender knows how to

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:43.259
bang out like a champ, a Colonel named Graff
drop by and invite his ass to Battle School-

00:01:43.259 --> 00:01:48.170
where he gonna learn to fight da buggers.
Peter pissed as hell that Ender got chosen

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.840
instead of him.
Up at battle school, it don't take long fo'

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:57.420
errybody to realize dat Ender the smartest
hood up in thurr fo sho- and cuz o dat, Graff

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:02.060
actually tryna' keep Ender from makin' legit
friends, cuz he think da only way Ender can

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:07.229
get to the top of his game is if he flyin'
solo. When he ain't wreckin' shop in The Battle

00:02:07.229 --> 00:02:13.290
Room and trainin' other kids, Ender plays
the "mind game"- a computer program dat analyzes

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:18.290
kid's psychology. None of dem kids can get
past a part of da game called "The Giants

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:22.950
Game" where a brutha gotta pick between two
cups o' drank, one of which gonna kill em.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:28.569
Afta' Ender gets merced by dat killa' sizzurp
fo' da millionth time, he straps up again:

00:02:28.569 --> 00:02:34.190
Instead of sippin,' he knocks over dat joose
and burrows a damn hole in the giant's EYE.

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:39.569
DAMN. Thing is, Ender cain't stand doin sh**
like that cuz it remind him of his brother

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:44.790
Peter. Dude even say "This was supposed to
be a game.... I'm a murderer, even when I

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.830
play." (65)
Ender gets promoted in and transferred to

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:52.260
armies left n right, and eventually
callin' the shots as commander of his own

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:57.920
army. Along da way, Ender makin' all kinds
of enemies who jealous of his mad gangsta

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:03.099
skillz. When one of his haters- some boy named
Bonzo who way older and bigger than Ender,

00:03:03.099 --> 00:03:09.590
tries to boot up in the shower, Ender do what
he always do: he make DAMN sho' dat Bonzo

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:14.760
ain't eva' gonna try and scrap wit' him again.
ENDER ICES DAT FOOL TOO- but jus' like last

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:20.470
time, he don't even know it til' later.
10 years old now, Ender real tired of all

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:25.480
his teachers' sh** at the Battle School: errytime
he get close to somebody, or shows dat he

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:30.890
got all da games SOWED UP, the rules change
and Ender goes back to grindin all day erry

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:36.159
day. Eventually, Ender has HAD it and wanna
jus' peace da fu** out. So Graff takes Ender

00:03:36.159 --> 00:03:40.040
back to earth so that Valentine can give him
a pep talk.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:45.599
While Ender been whoopin' ass in space, Valentine
and Peter been busy too: see, it turns out

00:03:45.599 --> 00:03:50.819
that Val and Pete got brains jus as big as Ender.
Da only reason they didn't get picked by Graff

00:03:50.819 --> 00:03:56.690
is cuz Val too nice, and Peter too insane
in the membrane, always killin' sh**. Even

00:03:56.690 --> 00:04:01.230
though they jus' lil kids, Pete and Val know
that people all ova' da world ain't jus' ready

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:06.510
fo' war with the Buggers; nah, blood- they
also gonna beef wit' eachotha. Val and Pete

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:11.459
realize dat humanity ain't gonna last unless
somebody with brains runnin' the show- so

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:17.489
they get up on dat futuristic Facebook and
start gettin' mad street cred talkin' politics.

00:04:17.489 --> 00:04:21.909
Ender finally gets his sh** together, but
don't go back to the Battle School: da military

00:04:21.909 --> 00:04:26.919
decide da clock is tickin wit da buggers, so
they send his ass to Command School, even

00:04:26.919 --> 00:04:32.190
though he ain't even close to 16 yet.
There, Ender meet a dude with some major swagger-

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:37.669
Rackham, the OG general dat whooped the Buggers
back in the day. Afta' some choice words from

00:04:37.669 --> 00:04:43.500
the big dawg, Ender goes in to a new simulator
where he commanding a posse of his own. Fo'

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:48.750
days, Ender fights battle after battle, some
of em seem straight up impossible! But in

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:54.699
the end, Ender keeps it real and always finish
numba' one- even destroying the entire Bugger

00:04:54.699 --> 00:04:59.870
planet. Erryone on the base all geeked at
the win and Rackham tell Ender: "That wasn't

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:05.699
no simulation bro. You just killed all the
buggers fo' real." OH NO YOU DIDN'T!

00:05:05.699 --> 00:05:10.590
Ender feelin' so sh**ty for committin' genocide
dat he passes da fu** out, goin in and out

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:15.210
of consciousness while humanity go and make
an ass of itself: RIGHT after takin' care

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:22.310
of the buggers, peeps worldwide are at eachother's
throats. C'mon FO REAL? But guess who come out on

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:26.210
top: Peter, Ender's brother. Scary ass family,
mayne.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:31.960
When erryone realize Ender too dangerous to
allow back on Earth, E-dawg and Valentine

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:37.460
throw up the deuces and start helpin' colonize
empty bugger worlds. Along the way, Ender

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:43.380
actually finds the pupa of a queen bugger,
ready to hatch a hundred thousand lil buggers.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:48.780
Turns out, da buggers been readin' his mind
fo' years. So does he smoke dat ho? Nuh-uh

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:53.900
playa. Ender better than that. He and Valentine
snatch her up and keep on cruising, hopin'

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:57.820
to find a place where the hive queen can set
up shop in peace.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.600
This book right here might be called Ender's

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:09.740
GAME, but Ender sho as hell ain't playin.
Him, Peter and Valentine got PHAT brains that

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:14.870
make em some real badasses. Their swole abilities
in line with one of the dankest themes of

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:20.520
da book: the power to understand others. Peter
digs up people's fears and uses it against

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.729
them, Valentine figgers out what people love
about themselves and flatters em', and Ender

00:06:25.729 --> 00:06:30.789
got the ability to look deep in to sombody, and
think like them. Card actually wavin' dat

00:06:30.789 --> 00:06:36.389
symbol in our faces on page 11, where we got
Ender tryin' on a bugger mask and wonderin'

00:06:36.389 --> 00:06:42.140
what Buggers think bout humans. Fo' Ender,
this power it's both a blessing and a curse.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:47.120
On one hand, he able to use it to smack up
his enemies like a G. Like Ender say:

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:52.100
"Every time, I've won because I could understand
the way my enemy thought. From what they did.

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:56.210
I could tell what they thought I was doing,
how they wanted the battle to take shape."

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:58.889
(238)
Ain't all gravy though, Errytime Ender mops

00:06:58.889 --> 00:07:02.009
the floor wit' somebody, he kills a little
piece of himself:

00:07:02.009 --> 00:07:06.830
"In the moment when I truly understand my
enemy, understand him well enough to defeat

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:11.849
him, then in that very moment I also love
him…. And then, in that very moment when

00:07:11.849 --> 00:07:16.539
I love them… I destroy them. I make it impossible
for them to ever hurt me again." (238)

00:07:16.539 --> 00:07:22.000
So when Ender learn that he wiped out a whole
colony, you best BELIEVE dat messed him up.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.610
And speakin' of messed up, dat mind game is
all kinda whacked- or at least, what it shows

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:31.770
us is. Not only does the mind game bring together
the themes of Ender's guilt, and games, but

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:36.840
it also reppin' dat ain't NUTHIN gonna stop
Ender from doin' what he gotta do. And in

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:42.289
Ender's case, we see over and over dat in
order for him to become top-dawg, he's gotta

00:07:42.289 --> 00:07:47.060
straight up kill children.
Not only does Ender kill kids in the mind

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:53.250
game and also outside it: Stilson, Bonzo,
an even his own childhood... Not to mention

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:57.430
a million lil' bugger kids.
Through the Giant's Drink again, past the

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:02.610
wolf-children, reliving the terrible deaths,
the constant murders; he heard a voice whispering

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:06.789
in the forest, You had to kill the children
to get to the End of the World." (300)

00:08:06.789 --> 00:08:11.310
So can we blame Ender fo' bein' a killin'
machine? Or do Graff, Racham, and all da other

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:16.270
peeps that made Ender what he is have to ride
the beef? Sho, at the end of the book, da

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:21.419
court finds Ender not guilty for Bonzo and
Stilson's deaths, sayin' he acted in self

00:08:21.419 --> 00:08:25.699
defense. But don't forget what Rackham say
to Ender about the buggers:

00:08:25.699 --> 00:08:29.710
Don't start apologizing for them, Ender. Just
because they didn't know they were killing

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:33.330
human beings doesn't mean they weren't killing
human beings." (270)

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:41.440
I guess dat Ender thought like da buggers
even mo' than he could have imagined. Hey, thanks for keepin' it real with me today, peace.

